---
const cards = {
  welcome: '/images/premium/torah-mobile-portrait.webp',
  vision: '/images/premium/torah-hero-desktop-16x9-v2.webp',
  expect: '/images/premium/blue-glass-star.webp',
  community: '/images/Community.PNG'
};
---

<section class="oht-features-section" aria-labelledby="oht-features-title">
    <div class="oht-features-header">
        <div class="oht-features-heading">
            <h2 id="oht-features-title">Welcome to Ohr HaTorah.</h2>
            <p>Light of the Torah - ancient wisdom, contemporary understanding.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="oht-features-action">
            <a href="/services" class="liquid-glass oht-liquid-button">Plan a Visit</a>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="oht-features-grid">
        <article class="feature-card oht-feature-card oht-feature-card-tall">
            <img class="oht-card-image" src={cards.welcome} alt="Torah scroll and Jerusalem stone in warm light" loading="lazy">
            <div class="relative oht-card-row oht-muted-row">
                <span>01/</span>
                <span>Welcome</span>
            </div>
            <div class="oht-card-spacer"></div>
            <div class="relative oht-card-copy">
                <h3>Where Ancient Wisdom<br>Meets Living Faith</h3>
                <div class="oht-card-divider"></div>
                <p>Welcome to Ohr HaTorah, where ancient wisdom meets contemporary understanding. Our congregation explores Jewish tradition while embracing Yeshua as the Messiah.</p>
            </div>
        </article>

        <article class="feature-card-dark oht-feature-card oht-feature-card-wide">
            <img class="oht-card-image" src={cards.vision} alt="Torah scroll overlooking Jerusalem" loading="lazy">
            <div class="relative oht-card-row">
                <h3>Our Vision</h3>
                <span class="oht-card-number">02/</span>
            </div>
            <div class="oht-card-spacer oht-card-spacer-large"></div>
            <p class="relative oht-card-bottom-note oht-card-bottom-note-left">A community where Jewish tradition and faith in Yeshua come together harmoniously, and where Jewish and non-Jewish believers can grow in faith and understanding.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="feature-card oht-feature-card">
            <img class="oht-card-image" src={cards.expect} alt="Blue glass Star of David detail" loading="lazy">
            <div class="relative oht-card-row oht-muted-row">
                <span>What to Expect</span>
                <span>03/</span>
            </div>
            <p class="relative oht-card-body-copy">Warm welcome, traditional Jewish liturgy, engaging Torah study, children's programs, and fellowship opportunities.</p>
            <div class="oht-card-spacer"></div>
            <div class="relative oht-card-bottom">
                <a href="/expect" class="liquid-glass oht-liquid-button">What to Expect</a>
            </div>
        </article>

        <article class="feature-card oht-feature-card">
            <img class="oht-card-image" src={cards.community} alt="Ohr HaTorah community gathering" loading="lazy">
            <div class="relative oht-card-row oht-muted-row">
                <span>Community</span>
                <span>04/</span>
            </div>
            <div class="oht-card-spacer"></div>
            <p class="relative oht-card-bottom-note">A diverse and welcoming community united in love for God, Jewish tradition, and faith in Yeshua.</p>
        </article>
    </div>
</section>
